    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Owen Reilly presents this superb, newly refurbished two-bedroom, ground-floor apartment, ideally situated within the highly sought-after Westland Square development in the heart of Dublin city centre, adjacent to Trinity College Dublin. This small, secure and gated development offers residents an exceptionally convenient city-centre lifestyle, with an excellent range of amenities right on the doorstep.\r\n\r\nThe beautifully presented accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a bright and spacious open-plan living, dining and kitchen area. The main double bedroom is generously proportioned. The second bedroom is currently configured as a home office, offering a versatile space that can easily function as a bedroom, guest room or dedicated workspace. A well-appointed bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned in one of Dublin’s most convenient city-centre locations, this stylish, newly refurbished apartment is ready for immediate occupation.\r\n\r\nMore about the location...\r\n\r\nWestland Square enjoys an exceptional city-centre location adjacent to Trinity College Dublin and just moments from Pearse Street DART and train station, providing excellent connectivity across Dublin and beyond. Grafton Street, Merrion Square, Grand Canal Dock, the IFSC and St Stephen’s Green are all within easy walking distance. The surrounding area offers an outstanding selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, shops and cultural attractions, while numerous Dublin Bus routes and the Luas are also easily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Newly refurbished two-bedroom apartment.\r\nGround-floor position.\r\nBright and spacious open-plan living/dining area.\r\nContemporary fitted kitchen.\r\nSecond bedroom currently configured as a home office.\r\nSecure gated development.\r\nPrime Dublin 2 location.\r\nAdjacent to Trinity College Dublin.\r\nMoments from Pearse Street DART and train station.\r\nWalking distance to Grafton Street, Merrion Square, Grand Canal Dock and St Stephen’s Green.\r\nExcellent public transport links.\r\nWide range of cafés, restaurants, shops and amenities on the doorstep."
      },
      {
